      "locked": false,
      "text": "EMOTION SERVICE\n\nFastAPI + funasr\nemotion2vec_plus_base\nCPU inference, one request\nat a time\n\nPOST /score\n• ffmpeg cuts rep segments\n• emotion2vec returns scores\n• temporary files cleaned up",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EMOTION SERVICE\n\nFastAPI + funasr\nemotion2vec_plus_base\nCPU inference, one request\nat a time\n\nPOST /score\n• ffmpeg cuts rep segments\n• emotion2vec returns scores\n• temporary files cleaned up",
      "autoResize": true,
