      "locked": false,
      "text": "DATA + STORAGE\n\nNeon PostgreSQL via Prisma\n\nJob → Word[] → Segment[]\n       ↘ Result\n\nLocal uploads/ stores WAV files\nEach job references its file path\n",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
